1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,696
SARGE! Why is the Ogryn CARRYING me?!

2
00:00:04,346 --> 00:00:07,606
Orders. You're his job now, son.

3
00:00:08,156 --> 00:00:12,889
Sarge say protect little 'un. So Grunk protect!

4
00:00:13,739 --> 00:00:17,820
Ogryns can barely count. But they never, ever break.

5
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:21,294
Grunk... how many Orks are coming?

6
00:00:21,364 --> 00:00:26,921
One... two... um... LOTS!

7
00:00:28,471 --> 00:00:30,446
FOR DA EMPRAH!

8
00:00:31,446 --> 00:00:34,766
Fight's over, big lad. You can rest now.

9
00:00:34,836 --> 00:00:36,701
Not till little 'un wakes up.

10
00:00:38,101 --> 00:00:43,218
You stayed up all night? Grunk... you're the best soldier in the Guard.

11
00:00:43,968 --> 00:00:45,120
...Wot's a Guard?

